1) Select -Dropdown
-- Dropdown having tag as 'Select'

Action:
-------
Webelement e=d.findElement(by.xpath(//xpath)) ----> find the element of the dropdown field
Select fil=new Select(e);

// pass the WebElement in the "Select" class

//method to select the value from dropdown
 - fil.selectByVisibleText("//value//") ----> pass the inner text of the dropdown value
 -fil.selectByValue("//value//")  -----> pass the value in "Value" attribute for the dropdown value
 -file.selectByIndex(//int) ----> pass the index of the Dropdown value starts from 0
//get all options from dropdown
-fil.getOptions() ---> this will return all the dropdown values as List<WebElement>

